<title>UK: UK's DTI details merger clearances.</title>
<headline>UK's DTI details merger clearances.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry said on Tuesday it had cleared the following proposed mergers:</p>
<p>--the proposed acquisition by Dana Corporation of Ingersoll-Rand Co's Clark Hurth business.</p>
<p>--the proposed acquisition by Thermo Instrument Systems Inc. of Life Sciences International Plc.</p>
<p>--the proposed acquisition by NT on behalf of Ingersoll-Rand Co. of Newman Tonks Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
